// Granted/revoked by OverdriveDamageSkillAction (Begin/End paired) - Applied latches true the
// moment this action's own correction fires (RageOverdrive.Overdriven flipping true, checked each
// OnGoing tick since Overdrive can trigger any time mid-activation from a landed hit, not at a
// fixed lifecycle point), so it doesn't reapply every tick for the rest of the activation. Kept
// separate from RageOverdrive itself rather than adding a field there, since this is a second,
// independent upgrade reacting to the same flag - RageOverdrive only ever needs to know whether
// anything has consumed it, not track each consumer individually.
component WeaponDamageOverdrive
{
    Boolean Applied;
}
